    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Oh, that wasn’t me; that was who you needed to hear.”</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, you can perfectly mimic the <strong>voice, accent, and speech patterns</strong> of a creature whose voice you have heard for at least 1 minute.</p><ul><li>This mimicry lasts for up to <strong>1 minute</strong>.</li><li>Creatures who are familiar with the imitated voice can make an <strong>Insight (Soul)</strong> check vs your <strong>Stealth (Intrigue)</strong> to notice something is off.</li></ul><p>This does not grant you their knowledge—just their sound.</p>",
